    "Description": "Vim (Vi IMproved) is an updated and improved version of the vi editor.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* vim: Vimscript injection via unescaped filename in netrw s:NetrwMarkFile() filter() expression allows arbitrary code execution (CVE-2026-43961)\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* vim writes file in place even though creating a backup is possible [rhel-9.8.z] (JIRA:RHEL-282858)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
